            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hluboký, tlumený – jako vzdálený vodopád."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deep silence and drips; someone explores a cave and digs with a pickaxe, pebbles fall. A different story every night.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deep silence and drips; someone explores a cave and digs with a pickaxe, pebbles fall. A different story every night."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hlboké ticho a kvapky; niekto skúma jaskyňu, kope krompáčom a padajú kamienky. Každú noc iný príbeh."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hluboké ticho a kapky; někdo zkoumá jeskyni, kope krumpáčem a padají kamínky. Každou noc jiný příběh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
