    },
    "SleepHole's signature runs out at the date above. Before then, connect your iPhone to the Mac and install SleepHole again – your data stays. You'll get a reminder a day and 3 hours ahead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
